7. train_output_matrix  (data/train_output_matrix.rda)
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Content:    313,856 x 98 one-hot matrix of respondent country (columns
            s003_<ISO 3166-1 numeric code>).
Source:     World Values Survey country variable s003 for the ML-CVI training
            sample; produced by MLScripts 1.2 in the OSF archive.
Rights:     Derived from WVS data; see entry 9 for the WVS terms question.

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
8. wvs_country_codes  (data/wvs_country_codes.rda)
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Content:    98 rows mapping WVS numeric country codes (ISO 3166-1 numeric)
            to ISO 3166-1 alpha-3 codes and English names.
Source:     ISO 3166-1 table from the CRAN package ISOcodes (data-raw/
            make_country_codes.R), itself derived from the Debian iso-codes
            project.
Rights:     ISOcodes is GPL-2 | GPL-3; the iso-codes data are LGPL-2.1.
            Redistributing 98 code/name pairs is within those terms.

